WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:07.053
Welcome to Graphic Design Essentials. Good design helps people understand a message quickly.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.443
Contrast makes important things stand out, with size, colour or weight.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:17.150
Alignment: line things up, so the design looks organised.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.291
Repetition: reuse the same colours and fonts.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.955
Proximity: keep related things close together.

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:30.562
And white space: leave room to breathe. Crowded designs are hard to read.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:39.957
Before you move on, check: Name the five principles. Find one poster and list what works. Suggest one improvement using a principle.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.385
In the next lesson: Colour.
